      "filename": "Garfield Avenue, Alhambra, California (14494684856).jpg",
      "title": "File:Garfield Avenue, Alhambra, California (14494684856).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/Garfield_Avenue%2C_Alhambra%2C_California_%2814494684856%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Garfield_Avenue,_Alhambra,_California_(14494684856).jpg",
